@startuml
title Sequence Diagram – Mendaftarkan Data Motor

actor Pelanggan
participant "MotorSayaView" as MotorSayaView
participant "App (state)" as App

Pelanggan -> MotorSayaView: Isi nama pemilik, merek, tipe/model, plat

MotorSayaView -> App: setMotorDraft(data)

MotorSayaView --> Pelanggan: Ringkasan data motor diperbarui

Pelanggan -> MotorSayaView: Klik "Simpan Data Motor"

MotorSayaView -> App: handleSaveMotor()

alt merek & tipe/model terisi
    App --> MotorSayaView: setSavedMotor(data); setMotorError("")
    App --> Pelanggan: Toast: "Profil Motor Saya berhasil disimpan"

else merek / tipe kosong
    App --> MotorSayaView: setMotorError("Isi minimal merek dan tipe/model...")
    App --> Pelanggan: Tampilkan pesan error
end

@enduml